"""
Agent-credential currency -- expiry visibility, identity-block flags,
audit identity, memory-write provenance, delegation records, tracing.

Covers the v8 migration (audit_events.user_id,
corrections.source_surface, reflections.created_by, delegation_records)
and the wiring around it:

  - gate_agents records an agent_identity_blocked integrity flag when a
    store is threaded in (and never fails dispatch when it is broken);
  - register/rotate surface the identity token's expires_at;
  - DeliberationAuditor / audited_round_table thread the acting user;
  - corrections record their write surface, reflections their creator;
  - DELEGATION_RECORDS_ENABLED writes phase-derivation rows (default
    off: zero rows, byte-identical dispatch);
  - phase_span degrades to a no-op without the [otel] extra.
"""

